    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>FOLLOW US ON DISCORD</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>FOLLOW US ON TWITTER</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578960/extras/84af73d389533894e211675a346cb398.avif?t=1657192542\" /></div><br> \u2191\u2191\u2191\u2191\u2191\u2191 <u>Click Me</u> \u2191\u2191\u2191\u2191\u2191\u2191 </p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578960/extras/65210292163c1b1fc447e170b7975225.poster.avif?t=1657192542\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578960/extras/65210292163c1b1fc447e170b7975225.webm?t=1657192542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578960/extras/65210292163c1b1fc447e170b7975225.mp4?t=1657192542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>VAR: Exterminate; Zombie rough-lite shooter that promises raw exhilarating horror with vast replayability. Designed exclusively for VR, immerse yourself in a post-apocalyptic city overrun by zombies<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dictate your outcome</h2>Pick one of the 3 abilities offered to you at the beginning of every wave! Form your own ability tree and take on waves of relentless zombie attacks. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578960/extras/0793721e9bd440461f2d3e22bb98b509.avif?t=1657192542\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Immersive zombie survival</h2>Eliminate zombies crawling all over the city, loot the undead to get money and chips to upgrade your weapons and equipment.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578960/extras/a45ec88017d1e9ae2639f5e7331abf76.avif?t=1657192542\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rich and high-quality game content</h2>There are 12 stages built for 2 Chapters. More will be added over time for free, so check back for more maps, stages, and chapters later.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578960/extras/d908888ef2f6dd0a23a54107304d551a.avif?t=1657192542\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pick your style</h2> Whether you\u2019re a gunslinging cowboy or a grenade launching trooper. Exterminate offers an array of weapons for you to take the undead out in style.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Global Ranking</h2> Have what it takes to be a top dog? Challenge yourself against players over the world and fight out if you really have what it takes to be the toughest mercenary in the field!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Only in VR</h2>VAR: Exterminate is a zombie shooter built exclusively for VR. Step into the midst of a zombie apocalypse and join the fight to take back what is rightfully ours!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578960/extras/65210292163c1b1fc447e170b7975225.poster.avif?t=1657192542\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578960/extras/65210292163c1b1fc447e170b7975225.webm?t=1657192542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578960/extras/65210292163c1b1fc447e170b7975225.mp4?t=1657192542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>VAR: Exterminate; Zombie rough-lite shooter that promises raw exhilarating horror with vast replayability. Designed exclusively for VR, immerse yourself in a post-apocalyptic city overrun by zombies<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dictate your outcome</h2>Pick one of the 3 abilities offered to you at the beginning of every wave! Form your own ability tree and take on waves of relentless zombie attacks. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578960/extras/0793721e9bd440461f2d3e22bb98b509.avif?t=1657192542\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Immersive zombie survival</h2>Eliminate zombies crawling all over the city, loot the undead to get money and chips to upgrade your weapons and equipment.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578960/extras/a45ec88017d1e9ae2639f5e7331abf76.avif?t=1657192542\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rich and high-quality game content</h2>There are 12 stages built for 2 Chapters. More will be added over time for free, so check back for more maps, stages, and chapters later.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1578960/extras/d908888ef2f6dd0a23a54107304d551a.avif?t=1657192542\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pick your style</h2> Whether you\u2019re a gunslinging cowboy or a grenade launching trooper. Exterminate offers an array of weapons for you to take the undead out in style.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Global Ranking</h2> Have what it takes to be a top dog? Challenge yourself against players over the world and fight out if you really have what it takes to be the toughest mercenary in the field!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Only in VR</h2>VAR: Exterminate is a zombie shooter built exclusively for VR. Step into the midst of a zombie apocalypse and join the fight to take back what is rightfully ours!",
    "short_description": "The fight is here, humanity\u2019s fate is in your hands! Match up different offensive and defensive upgrades between waves and fend off the onslaught of zombies. Level up and strengthen core abilities and progress to new areas where strains of the virus have evolved.",
